{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>Will You slay even a righteous nation?</b> It is possible to interpret that Avimelekh was saying of himself: if You slay this nation, it will be a cause that the righteous one too will be slain — and he said this of Avraham, for if the king is slain on account of this deed, will not the king's servants slay Avraham?"], :book :genesis, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:13:46.439649441Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}